type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5/18(土)に開催される「Rakuten GirlsAward 2019 SPRING/SUMMER」にモデルとして出演させていただきます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、日向坂46のアーティストLIVEで出演することも決定しました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は「seventeen SPECIAL STAGE」にも出演しますのでお楽しみにしていてください♪♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今からすごく楽しみになってきました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"是非、遊びに来てください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"❀* ❀。. ✿ * ❀ ｡* ❀ ❀ * .❀ ｡ ✿ * ❀ ❀ ｡ ✿ *"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/201904/mob27R3d4.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4/29に幕張メッセで「黒い羊」個別握手会"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4/30に幕張メッセで「キュン」全国握手会"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"があります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2日間続けてとなりますが、会いに来てくれますか？？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全国握手会は第3レーンです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"キュン